<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-New Era of Networks started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-New Era of Networks started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said Monday it started coverage of New Era of Networks with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $28 per share, based on 40 times 1999 fully-taxed earnings per share estimate of $0.70.</p>
<p>-- Set 1997 estimate at loss $0.06, 1998 at profit $0.25.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 16-1/4.</p>
</text>
